{"id":"ccbc12:problem:b-p2063","answer":"RED CHILI","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>每条线是除了南极洲外，每个大洲最长河流的形状。</p>","text":"每条线是除了南极洲外，每个大洲最长河流的形状。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>每个点是一座城市（注意：绿色的点是米尔杜拉）。根据点的颜色在彩虹中的顺序，提取对应城市名中的字母，再按线的颜色在彩虹中的顺序排序。</p>","text":"每个点是一座城市（注意：绿色的点是米尔杜拉）。根据点的颜色在彩虹中的顺序，提取对应城市名中的字母，再按线的颜色在彩虹中的顺序排序。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>根据“蜿蜒”提示观察图片可以发现，六条线条的形状分别对应六大洲中最长的河流（例如黄色对应的长江是亚洲最长河流），而每条线上的一个圆点对应一座沿河城市。根据圆点的彩虹色在每个城市名中提取一个或两个字母，再按照线条的彩虹色排序得到答案：<strong>RED CHILI</strong>。</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>颜色</span><span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>河流 &amp; </span><span>大洲</span></section><section><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>城市名</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>圆点颜色</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>提取字母</span><span></span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>红（1）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>亚马孙河</span></section><section><span>南美洲</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span><span>SANTAREM</span></span></section><section><span><span>圣塔伦</span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>蓝+紫（6+7）</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>RE</span></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>橙</span><span>（2）</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>墨累河</span></section><section><span>大洋洲</span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>MILDURA</span></section><section><span>米尔杜拉</span><span></span><span></span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>绿（4）</span><span></span></sec